      "title": "A new account \u2014 390 \u00d7 844",
      "caption": "The item was a Login: a username, a password, and an authenticator tacked on. It is an Account now \u2014 a username or id, the sites it lives at, and a list of the ways it logs in. Same editor, same keys; the password is one method among several.",
