      "title": "Password generators \u2014 390 \u00d7 844",
      "caption": "The generator was a popover on the password field with two modes. It is a choice on the password method itself: Rules (Bitwarden-style minimum digits and symbols), Passphrase, Sphinx \u2014 an RFC 9497 oblivious PRF, so the password is computed from a master input and never stored \u2014 and Manual.",
      "before": "2 generators: Characters, Passphrase",
      "after": "4 generators: Rules, Passphrase, Sphinx, Manual"
    },
